Description: Ruby 4.0 interpreter
 Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks. Configured as darwin so Fiber uses
 the arm64 assembly coroutine and process spawning stays available.
 Kernel#system and Kernel#exec with a shell use /var/jb/bin/sh.
 .
 YJIT and ZJIT are not built. The interpreter is enough for a working ruby;
 a later package revision may add them.
